{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-jr400","title":"Buture JR400 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 400W 38KPA","description":"\u003ch3\u003eButure JR400 Portable Carpet Cleaner\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile cordless vacuums are not suitable for long-pile carpets, they are ideal for most other low-pile carpets. Low-pile carpets often accumulate dust and debris that can be challenging to clean with traditional vacuums. A portable carpet cleaner like the Buture JR400 offers the perfect blend of power and convenience to tackle these challenges effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUnmatched Power and Convenience\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR400 is designed to provide impressive cleaning power in a portable format. With adjustable suction power ranging from 18 kPa to 38 kPa and a 400W motor, this portable carpet cleaner tackles even the toughest carpet stains with ease. The touchscreen interface allows you to adjust the power settings with a simple slide of your finger, ensuring you have the right amount of power for every cleaning task.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEasy Unboxing and Assembly\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen you receive your Buture JR400, you’ll appreciate the detailed instructions provided right on the box. Inside, you’ll find a multilingual manual, making assembly straightforward and hassle-free. The components include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ergonomically designed for comfortable use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrush Attachments\u003c\/strong\u003e: Versatile tools for different cleaning needs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharger and Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ensures your portable carpet cleaner is always ready to go.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePower Plug and Cleaner Brush\u003c\/strong\u003e: Essential for maintaining your vacuum.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eQuick and Simple Setup\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAssembling the Buture JR400 is a breeze. Just follow these steps:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAttach the handle to the main body.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnect the brush attachment of your choice.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInsert the battery and power plug.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn just a few clicks, your portable carpet cleaner is ready to tackle any mess.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVersatile Cleaning Capabilities\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR400 isn’t just powerful; it’s incredibly versatile. Whether you need to clean tight corners, under furniture, or between couch cushions, this portable carpet cleaner has you covered. The brush attachments are perfect for various surfaces, and the extension bar helps you reach high and low spots effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEasy Maintenance and Storage\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMaintaining the Buture JR400 is simple. The vacuum comes with three HEPA filters—one pre-installed and two spares. When it’s time to clean the dust container, just pop it open and empty it. If the filter gets too dirty, swapping it out is a breeze. After use, you can charge the vacuum and hang it on the wall using the included hook, keeping your space clutter-free.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure JR400 Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .jr400-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .jr400-table th, .jr400-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .jr400-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .jr400-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"width: 99.9676%; h